## Why This Is Asked

This question evaluates practical experience designing observable, scalable Azure telemetry pipelines with proper instrumentation, tenant isolation, and comprehensive monitoring integration for enterprise-grade media analytics platforms.

## Key Concepts

- OpenTelemetry integration across Event Hubs, Databricks, and Delta Lake
- End-to-end trace correlation and structured logging
- Adaptive sampling strategies and retention policies
- Tenant-level RBAC and data governance
- Comprehensive monitoring with Application Insights and Azure Monitor
- Real-time alerting and SLA management

## Code Example

```javascript
// Propagate correlation across services
const traceHeader = appInsights.getCorrelationContext();
const traceId = traceHeader.traceId;

// Instrument Event Hubs producer
eventHubProducer.send({
  body: eventData,
  properties: {
    traceId: traceId,
    tenantId: tenantId,
    region: region,
    timestamp: new Date().toISOString()
  }
});

// Configure OpenTelemetry sampling
const sampler = new ParentBasedSampler({
  root: new TraceIdRatioBasedSampler(0.01) // 1% production
});
```

